// Shadowfetch Phoenix Recovery 2.1.2 "Fire Edition".
// Free-space guard, deliberately numbered 79 so it sorts BEFORE snapper's
// shipped 80snapper: space is reclaimed (snapper number-cleanup + stale
// @_prev GC) before the pre-transaction Phoenix Point is taken, so a big
// dist-upgrade cannot ENOSPC mid-dpkg between snapper-cleanup timer runs.
// The hook never blocks the transaction: the script always exits 0 and the
// invocation is belt-and-braces guarded with || true.
DPkg::Pre-Invoke { "/usr/libexec/phoenix-space-check || true"; };
